<view class="page">
  <view class="header"><view class="eyebrow gold">A LITTLE MORE LUCK</view><view class="title">把好运，攒起来。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="demo-badge">本地演示 · 不接真实广告</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 点击重试</view>
  <view class="wallet-card"><view class="row"><text>可用积分</text><text class="wallet-symbol">◈</text></view><view class="wallet-balance">{{balance}}</view><view class="wallet-footer">仅用于游戏体验，不可充值、提现或转让</view></view>
  <view class="card reward-card"><view class="row"><view class="reward-icon">☀</view><view class="reward-copy"><view class="section-title">每日签到</view><view class="subtitle">每天 +{{rules.daily}} 积分 · 已连续 {{rewards.streak}} 天</view></view><t-button theme="primary" size="small" disabled="{{busy || rewards.signed || !ready}}" bindtap="sign">{{rewards.signed ? '已签到' : '签到'}}</t-button></view><view class="week-dots"><view wx:for="{{[1,2,3,4,5,6,7]}}" wx:key="*this" class="day-dot {{item <= rewards.streak ? 'done' : ''}}"><text>{{item <= rewards.streak ? '✓' : item}}</text><text>{{item}} 天</text></view></view><view class="small muted">每日北京时间 00:00 更新，断签后重新累计</view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="reward-icon video-icon">▶</view><view class="reward-copy"><view class="section-title">{{demo ? '体验模拟广告' : '观看视频得积分'}}</view><view class="subtitle">完整观看 +{{rules.adReward}} · 今日 {{rewards.adCount}}/{{rules.adDailyLimit}}</view></view></view><view class="spaced"><t-button theme="primary" variant="outline" block disabled="{{busy || !rewards.adEnabled || rewards.adCount >= rules.adDailyLimit || !ready}}" loading="{{busy &amp;&amp; !showAd}}" bindtap="watch">{{!rewards.adEnabled ? '广告暂未开放' : demo ? '开始 6 秒模拟体验' : '观看激励视频'}}</t-button></view><view class="small muted spaced">{{demo ? '这是演示倒计时，不会加载广告。离开或提前关闭不送积分。' : '自愿观看，提前关闭不送积分；无广告时可稍后再试。'}}</view><button wx:if="{{pendingAd}}" class="secondary spaced" bindtap="recoverAd" disabled="{{busy}}">确认上一笔广告奖励</button></view>
  <view class="row spaced"><text class="section-title">积分足迹</text><text class="muted">每一笔都有记录</text></view>
  <view class="card spaced"><view wx:if="{{!ledgers.length}}" class="empty">暂无积分流水</view><view wx:for="{{ledgers}}" wx:key="seq" class="ledger"><view><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted ledger-time">{{item.time}} · 余额 {{item.balanceAfter}}</view></view><text class="ledger-delta {{item.delta > 0 ? 'positive' : 'negative'}}">{{item.deltaText}}</text></view><button wx:if="{{cursor}}" class="secondary spaced" bindtap="more" loading="{{loadingMore}}">加载更多</button></view>
  <view class="footnote">快乐有记录，积分无现金价值。</view>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{showAd}}" class="modal-mask" catchtouchmove="noop"><view class="modal ad-modal"><view class="demo-badge">模拟广告 · 无真实广告内容</view><view class="ad-art">◈</view><view class="title">给好运，一点时间。</view><view class="subtitle spaced">{{remaining ? '保持当前页面，倒计时结束后领取演示积分' : '模拟体验已完成，可以领取积分'}}</view><view class="ad-countdown">{{remaining ? remaining + ' 秒' : '+200'}}</view><button class="primary" disabled="{{remaining > 0}}" bindtap="completeDemo">{{remaining ? '体验进行中' : '领取 200 积分'}}</button><button class="secondary spaced" bindtap="cancelDemo">关闭，不领取</button></view></view>
